  "raw_text": "PLAN \"1-Week Deload (Phase 0)\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary strength:\n    name \"Deload for transition to next training block\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Phase Deload\" (1 week):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 45m \"Deload Session A\":\n        warmup:\n          running 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 3x6..8 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          bent_over_row 3x6..8 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          overhead_press 2x6..8 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 60 seconds\n      DAY Tuesday training 40m \"Deload Session B\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          deadlift 2x5..7 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 3x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 60 seconds\n      DAY Wednesday rest\n      DAY Thursday training 45m \"Deload Session C\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          incline_press 3x6..8 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_row 3x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          dip 2x6..8 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          shoulder_stretch 60 seconds\n      DAY Friday training 40m \"Deload Session D\":\n        warmup:\n          jump_rope 4 minutes\n        main straight_sets:\n          leg_press 3x8..10 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          goblet_squat 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          calf_raise 3x12..15 rpe 5 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          calf_stretch 60 seconds\n      DAY Saturday Sunday rest",
